uto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c556" target="c558"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e562" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c558" target="c559"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e563" value="아니오" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c556" target="c557"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e564" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;dashed=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c557" target="c555"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><Array as="points"><mxPoint x="3535" y="6689" /><mxPoint x="3535" y="6594" /><mxPoint x="2815" y="6594" /><mxPoint x="2815" y="6623" /></Array></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="c567" value="기록기 시작 — 로봇 명단은 설정 파일에서 읽는다" style="ellipse;rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#E4ECF7;strokeColor=#3B6CA8;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2884" y="6938" width="400" height="34" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c568" value="여러 소식을 한꺼번에 듣는다&#10;접근 상태 · 운송 상태 · 비상정지 · 대상 거리 · 대상 보임&#10;미션 · 개입 · 구역 사건 · 웹캠2 힌트" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#5B87C4;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2884" y="6996" width="400" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c569" value="구독 QoS 를 발행자와 맞춘다&#10;명령 · 상태 · 미션은 확실히 받는 쪽(RELIABLE)&#10;카메라 · 라이다 · 힌트는 빠른 쪽(BEST_EFFORT)&#10;잘못 잡으면 그 항목이 통째로 빈 채로 시연이 끝난다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EFEFEF;strokeColor=#777777;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2884" y="7080" width="400" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c570" value="소식이 올 때마다 한 줄씩 적는다&#10;시각 · 어디서 · 어느 로봇 · 무엇 · 값 · 좌표" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#5B87C4;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2884" y="7178" width="400" height="45" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c571" value="시각은 ROS 시각만 쓴다 — 벽시계를 섞지 않는다&#10;로봇 · 웹캠 · 관제 기록을 나중에 한 파일로 합쳐야 하기 때문이다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#5B87C4;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2884" y="7247" width="400" height="45" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c572" value="한 줄을 파일에 덧붙여 쓴다 — 판정은 하지 않는다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EEF4FD;strokeColor=#5B87C4;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2884" y="7316" width="400" height="31" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="c573" value="기록 파일 — 사용자 홈의 kpi 폴더에 표 파일(CSV) 한 개&#10;ROS 노드가 아니다 — 이 노드가 파일에 직접 쓴다&#10;적는 열 — 시각 · 어디서 · 어느 로봇 · 무엇 · 값 · 좌표 x · 좌표 y · 덧붙임&#10;추종거리 · 놓침 · 리드타임 계산은 나중에 이 파일로 따로 한다" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=11;fillColor=#EFEFEF;strokeColor=#777777;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2884" y="7371" width="400" height="74" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e574" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c567" target="c568"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e575" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c568" target="c569"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e576" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c569" target="c570"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="e577" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;strokeColor=#4A4A4A;strokeWidth=1.4;fontFamily=Malgun Gothic;fontSize=10;fontColor=#4A4A4A;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;endArrow=block;endFill=1;endSize=6;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source=